    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d267-a3">

                <pb facs="0460" n="390" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg390"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Orleans,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 6, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Captain:</hi> Arrangements have been made with Major
                    General Sheridan to convey on the Black Bird John White, esq., to Tampico. Mr.
                    White goes to Mexico on business of great importance to the government, and it
                    is very desirable that you should go to Tampico with all the speed that may not
                    be unsafe.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully yours, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LEWIS D. CAMPBELL.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Captain U. S. Despatch Steamer Black Bird,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Galveston, Texas.</hi>
                    </p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
